{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-17","kind":"proposition","title":"三角形任意两内角之和小于平角","englishTitle":"In any triangle two angles taken together in any manner are less than two right angles.","book":1,"number":17,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.17","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.17/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":17,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","contentId":"euclid-1-17","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a33577e6e6b72d299c0a0371754ac5fffebce14006c697fb7a41008f3eba78c4","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-17.statement","euclid-1-17.construction.1","euclid-1-17.construction.2","euclid-1-17.proof.1","euclid-1-17.proof.2","euclid-1-17.proof.3","euclid-1-17.proof.4","euclid-1-17.proof.5","euclid-1-17.conclusion","euclid-1-17.historical.1","euclid-1-17.historical.2","euclid-1-17.historical.3","euclid-1-17.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-17.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf201db1afc9da39c0855eefff5ecc941f6a35fb0b684e1b60dfa69abafbccaa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In any triangle two angles taken together in any manner are less than two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在任何三角形中,两个角度以任何方式结合在一起,都不到两个直角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形之每两角必小于两直角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形任意两个内角的和，都小于两个直角的和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"91e5859c0cdca3ad2cbaa41206dde0216ac8a73f989b106b27eb73a490500de1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be a triangle; I say that two angles of the triangle ABC taken together in any manner are less than two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC成为三角形;我说,三角形ABC的两个角度以任何方式结合在一起,都不到两个直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e278f761b037949cafc9988558a8c4606c24da4831843ede79d07430e01b89f","citations":["euclid-1-post-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BC be produced to D. [[Post. 2](/principles/euclid-1-post-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC可以延长到D [[Post. 2](/principles/euclid-1-post-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4868d6e040d38f185a228d960e044ec47706da03f5587106e8da96e8eeb8735d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the angle ACD is an exterior angle of the triangle ABC,"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ACD角是三角形ABC的外角"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e50f8f74709a16f18bfa4e747bc066398bbdea3d756bd06316951869cd44f579","citations":["euclid-1-16","euclid-1-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"it is greater than the interior and opposite angle ABC. [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)] Let the angle ACB be added to each; therefore the angles ACD, ACB are greater than the angles ABC, BCA. But the angles ACD, ACB are equal to two right angles. [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"大于非近距离内距 ABC。 允许将角度 ACB 添加到每个角度; 因此, 角度 ACD , ACB 大于角度 ABC , BCA 。 但角度 ACD , ACB 等于 2 直角 。 [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)] [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c72770290d8631cb2eb37e78b16864f89a8a11a73c9a1b88b3278443e95c79f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angles ABC, BCA are less than two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ABC,BCA的角度小于2,直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eea3dfc07cf631558b4a00d49a18559582164bee53cf3c90770b9a7339938ed6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that the angles BAC, ACB are also less than two right angles, and so are the angles CAB, ABC as well."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明BAC,ACB的角度也低于2,直角,CAB,ABC的角度也是如此。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2cc824b2055a812a598c71c1e1f0ab4ff77731ec93571d94a8f3908eb7cad04d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形之每两角必小于两直角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形任意两个内角的和，都小于两个直角的和。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0611df6cbd003dc1a736283b6b250293675710a74794c1b899db0814f9ed17d0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙角形题言甲乙丙甲丙乙两角丙甲乙甲乙丙两角甲丙乙丙甲乙两角皆小于两直角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙 三角形命题解释 甲乙丙甲丙乙 两个角 丙甲乙甲乙丙 两个角 甲丙乙丙甲乙 两个角都小于两个直角"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"923b4d521020114033c120f119132faac35a700e7d3f527ca8be50865f490628","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试用两边线丙甲引出至戊丙乙引出至丁即甲乙丁外角大于相对之甲丙乙内角矣〈本篇十六〉此两率者每加一甲乙丙角则甲乙丁甲乙丙必大于甲丙乙甲乙丙矣〈公论四〉夫甲乙丁甲乙丙与两直角等也〈本篇十三〉则甲丙乙甲乙丙小于两直角也馀二仿此"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：尝试从 丙甲 到 戊丙乙 到 丁 画两条边线，这意味着 甲乙丁 的外角大于其对角 甲丙乙 的内角。〈本篇十六〉 对于这两种情况，每增加一个 甲乙丙 角，甲乙丁甲乙丙 必须大于 甲丙乙甲乙丙。〈公论四〉 甲乙丁甲乙丙 等于两个直角。如果 〈本篇十三〉 是 甲丙乙甲乙丙，那么 甲丙乙甲乙丙 小于两个直角。其他两个也类似。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-17.source","contentId":"euclid-1-17","revisionId":"euclid-1-17@raw-a33577e6e6b72d29","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b60d0fb5e76dfc572e5b9d18fd48dbfe71389b9f06599a6870d975a64edce380","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.17/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.17\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikiso